mes）”第 <REF_0001> 节。我们有一章讨论概形上的拟凝聚层的导出范畴（the derived category of quasi-coherent sheaves），见“概形的导出范畴（Derived Categories of Schemes）”第 <REF_0002> 节。我们有一章讨论 Noether 概形的对偶性（duality）以及概形态射的相对对偶性（relative duality），见“概形的对偶性（Duality for Schemes）”第 <REF_0003> 节。我们还有若干章节讨论概形的平展（<LATIN_0001>）上同调（cohomology）和概形的晶体上同调（crystalline cohomology）。不过，这些章节中的大部分材料都很基础，其中还可以或应当添加许多内容。", "translation_hash": "sha256:e773d092dfe6157cb7da01c815fee5c65ea4e3c01f37c31efc2ea36fe0fe3fca", "unit_id": "tag:02BE:p001", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "拟凝聚层的上同调理论。", "source_term": "cohomology of quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层的上同调"}, {"context": "被引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Cohomology of Schemes", "target_term": "概形的上同调"}, {"context": "概形上拟凝聚层的导出范畴。", "source_term": "the derived category of quasi-coherent sheaves", "target_term": "拟凝聚层的导出范畴"}, {"context": "被引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Derived Categories of Schemes", "target_term": "概形的导出范畴"}, {"context": "Noether 概形的对偶理论。", "source_term": "duality", "target_term": "对偶性"}, {"context": "概形态射的相对对偶理论。", "source_term": "relative duality", "target_term": "相对对偶性"}, {"context": "被引用章节标题。", "source_term": "Duality for Schemes", "target_term": "概形的对偶性"}, {"context": "概形的平展上同调。", "source_term": "cohomology", "target_term": "上同调"}, {"context": "概形的晶体上同调。", "source_term": "crystalline cohomology", "target_term": "晶体上同调"}]}
